      "id": "github:40556106",
      "name": "Wazuh",
      "track": "open_source",
      "summary": "Wazuh 是开源核心的安全平台：终端代理采集主机与云工作负载遥测，集中管理端做规则/行为检测生成告警，并可通过 active response 在终端执行阻断或远程查询。仓库主体为 GPL-2.0-only，src/engine 单独适用 AGPL-3.0-or-later。",
      "homepage": "https://wazuh.com/",
      "repository_url": "https://github.com/wazuh/wazuh",
      "github_repository_id": 40556106,
      "license": "GPL-2.0-only",
      "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/wazuh/wazuh/license",
      "license_review": {
        "reviewer": "opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash",
        "source_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/wazuh/wazuh/license",
        "spdx_id": "GPL-2.0-only",
        "scope": "community_core",
        "rationale": "Wazuh 仓库为混合许可：src/engine 为 AGPL-3.0-or-later，部分共享库为 GPL-2.0-only OR AGPL-3.0-or-later，其余主体为 GPL-2.0-only；本条按社区核心主体记为 GPL-2.0-only，engine 单独适用 AGPL。"
      },
      "features": [
        "终端代理采集日志、文件完整性、漏洞与恶意/rootkit 迹象",
        "规则与行为分析在集中管理端生成安全告警",
        "Wazuh Dashboard 提供安全事件与终端状态调查",
        "Active response 在终端执行阻断或远程查询",
        "云工作负载与容器遥测接入"
      ],
      "deployment": [
        "自建 Wazuh manager、indexer 与 dashboard",
        "在受管终端安装 Wazuh agent",
        "支持 Docker、Kubernetes、Ansible 等编排"
      ],
      "technology_stack": [
        "C/C++",
        "Python"
      ],
